description:
Design a module that performs a bitwise AND operation between two 32-bit inputs, `a` and `b`, and then outputs the result with reversed byte ordering. The final output will consist of the least significant byte of the AND result becoming the most significant byte and vice versa, effectively rearranging the byte positions in the output.
module top_module(
    input [31:0] a,
    input [31:0] b,
    output [31:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [31:0] a,
    input [31:0] b,
    output [31:0] out
);// Bitwise AND operation
    assign out = a & b;

    // Reverse byte ordering
    assign out = {out[7:0], out[15:8], out[23:16], out[31:24]};

endmodule

