description:
Design a 4-to-3 priority encoder that outputs a 3-bit binary code corresponding to the position of the highest-value active input signal. The module takes a 4-bit input and prioritizes the input signals from highest (data[3]) to lowest (data[0]), generating a code output that represents the index of the first active input (1). If no inputs are active, the output code is set to zero.
